64: /**
65:  * This abstract class provides the basic layout and event dispatching support
66:  * for all Property Panels.
67:  * <p>
68:  * The property panel is {@link org.tigris.swidgets.LabelledLayout} layed out as
69:  * a number (specified in the constructor) of equally sized panels that split
70:  * the available space. Each panel has a column of "captions" and matching
71:  * column of "fields" which are laid out indepently from the other panels.
72:  * <p>
73:  * The Properties panels for UML Model Elements are structured in an inheritance
74:  * hierarchy that matches the UML metamodel.
75:  */
76: public abstract class PropPanel extends AbstractArgoJPanel implements
77:         TabModelTarget, UMLUserInterfaceContainer {
