45: /**
46:  * This class implements an event pump for all modelevents (MEvents with the current
47:  * NSUML model). Two kinds of listeners can be registred to the pump: listeners
48:  * to class events and listeners to object events. The pump dispatches all
49:  * events fired by objects of a certain class to the class listeners (listeners
50:  * that are registred via addClassModelEventListener). Furthermore, it dispatches
51:  * all events to listeners that are registered for a certain object if this object
52:  * fired the original event.
53:  * <p>
54:  * Maybe this class should dispatch a thread to handle the incoming event in the
55:  * future.</p>
56:  * @since Oct 14, 2002
57:  * @author jaap.branderhorst@xs4all.nl
58:  */
