331:     /**
332:      * Sets the current theme, storing the new value in
333:      * Configuration. Argument should not be null, and argument class
334:      * should be an instance of MetalTheme.
335:      *
336:      * @param	themeClass	class name of desired theme
337:      **/
338:     public void setCurrentTheme(String themeClass) {
339:         MetalTheme theme = getMetalTheme(themeClass);
