46: /**
47:  * Controls the look and feel and theme of ArgoUML. LookAndFeelMgr has a
48:  * "Look and Feel" property which represents the Swing Pluggable Look-and-feel.
49:  * It also has a "Theme" property which represents a MetalTheme when the
50:  * Metal look-and-feel is selected.
51:  *
52:  * @author Bob Tarling
53:  * @author Jeremy Jones
